  "description": "[Beta Top Ji Yubin X Alpha Bottom Lee Taeseong]\n\nLee Taeseong, the grandson of pharmaceutical company N and a perfect alpha, had given up his wild lifestyle and planned to live quietly after a fight over management rights. But his plans get messed up when he meets Beta Ji Yubin.\n\n*\"I told you I'm making a game... I think I could develop other things too. Would you invest just once?\"*\n\nWhat am I supposed to do about this kid who wants to bed an alpha?\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000066071)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/bt_1111267), [German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dbd_00498)\n\n##### Note: All official translations are uncensored.",
